","s":"XI. 4. 7","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":".\n[page१-349+ ३३] to induce शिव to marry उमा.\n3: M. १५४. २०९-239.\nFor having observed विभू- तिद्वादशीव्रतम्, अनङ्गवती the courtesan became co-wife with Rati, and her name was प्रीति.\n4: "},{"t":"cite","s":"M. 7","q":"M"},{"t":"txt","s":". १३; १००. ३२९.\nIcon of.\n5: M. २६१. ५३-6.\nWorshipped शिव in सिद्धेश्वरम् and attained divinity again.\n6: M. १९१. ११०.\nHis arrow afflicted ब्रह्मा who was made to love his own daughter, cursed by ब्रह्मा to be burnt by Rudra; when pointed out that he only discharged his duty, he modified the curse to be born as son of कृष्ण, then of Vasu in Bharata line, to get overlordship of विद्याधरस् and finally attain godhood; afflicted the nine देवीस्.\n7: "},{"t":"cite","s":"M. 3","q":"M"},{"t":"txt","s":". ३३; 4. १२-21; २३. २३."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"(II)--a son of Samkalpa. भा. "},{"t":"cite","s":"VI. 6","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". १०."}]},{"n":3,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"(III)--a विश्वेदेव. Br. "},{"t":"cite","s":"III. 3","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". ३०; वा. ६६. ३१."}]},{"n":4,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"(IV)--the son of श्रद्धा and Dharma and father of हर्ष (joy) through his wife Rati (सिद्धि-ब्र्। प्।)। Br. "},{"t":"cite","s":"II. 9","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". ५८, ६२; वा. १०. ३४, ३८."}]},{"n":5,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"(V)--the Apsaras clan of Sobhayantya, originat- ed from. Br. "},{"t":"cite","s":"III. 7","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". २४; वा. ६९. ५८."}]},{"n":6,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"(VI)--place of, in life;\n1: भा. "},{"t":"cite","s":"I. 2. 9","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":"-१०;\ndoes not end in spite of भोग or enjoyment, but grows like fire with oblation; cf. रामायण; notwithstanding old age desire to live and to amass wealth does not go.\n2: वा. ९३. ९५, १००."}]}]}],"kamakarsaRika":[{"id":"kAmAkarzaRikA","headword":"कामाकर्षणिका","headword_slp1":"kAmAkarzaRikA","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"--a गुप्त शक्ति। Br. IV. १९. १७. [page१-350+ २९]"}]}]}],"kamakowiga":[{"id":"kAmakowigA","h